Package: maestria.metodos.estadisticos
Title: Soluciones de la Maestría — Métodos Estadísticos Avanzados
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Juan Nicolás", "Patiño Rodríguez",
           email = "nicolasimplant@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Working repository for the assignments of the "Advanced
    Statistical Methods" course. It consolidates the analysis code and the
    reproducible reports (Quarto) of every assignment, following a software
    engineering standard for R: modular architecture with box, OOP with R6,
    runtime contracts with checkmate, and quality control with lintr, styler,
    roxygen2 and testthat. This is not a distributable package; the Package
    field exists only so that renv and roxygen2 can discover dependencies.
